@@s003 <span class="blob">PCPP</span>
@@s004 atlas of Practical Concurrent and Parallel Programming
@@s005 Programs with <b>several threads</b> that work together on the same memory: when they work, when they break, and how one <b>proves</b> that they are correct. In Java, with a final part in Erlang.
